{"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OID4VCWallet is the wallet side of "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/IDFoundry\/OID4VCgo"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for iOS 16 and macOS 13 and later. It handles SD-JWT VC and ISO mdoc"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credentials:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Receiving"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" them from a Credential Offer (OpenID4VCI 1.0, HAIP 1.0),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with the authorization code or the pre-authorized code grant, deferred","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"issuance, batches of copies and refresh.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Presenting","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" them in answer to an "},{"code":"openid4vp:\/\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" request"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(OpenID4VP 1.0, HAIP 1.0), to Safari’s Digital Credentials API as an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"iOS document provider ("},{"code":"org-iso-mdoc","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", ISO\/IEC TS 18013-7), and in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"person over Bluetooth (ISO\/IEC 18013-5), where the app can also be the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reader."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The protocols run in OID4VCgo’s Go code, compiled into the "},{"code":"Mobile","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"framework this package links: every network request, every protocol"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"message and every check on what comes back. Your app supplies the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"platform, through three protocols: a "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore"},{"type":"text","text":" whose keys never leave"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the Secure Enclave, a "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStore"},{"type":"text","text":" under the device’s data"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"protection, and a "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" that attests the wallet. It also"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"owns the UI: every session stops where the holder needs to decide."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OID4VCgo is OpenID Certified for the OpenID4VCI and OpenID4VP wallet"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"roles under HAIP, over links. The Digital Credentials API and in-person"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presentation aren’t covered by that certification."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Start with "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GettingStarted"},{"type":"text","text":", then the article for each task."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GettingStarted","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HandlingErrors","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider"],"anchor":"Essentials"},{"title":"Keys and storage","identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyPurpose","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStore","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/InMemoryCredentialStore","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/StoreError"],"anchor":"Keys-and-storage"},{"title":"Receiving credentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ReceivingCredentials","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Offer","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/DeferredCredential","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/DeferredStatus"],"anchor":"Receiving-credentials"},{"title":"Holding credentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialDetail","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialDisplay","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStatus","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Logo","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/JSONValue"],"anchor":"Holding-credentials"},{"title":"Presenting from a link","identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/O